[color=#ff7700][size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size][/color]
[list]
[*][color=#93c47d]Octopath Traveler 0[/color][/*]
[*][color=#93c47d][url=https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases/tag/experimental-latest]UE4SS experimental latest[/url] — scroll down and download the release asset named like[/color]
[code]UE4SS_vX.X.X-XXXX-gXXXXXXXX.zip[/code]
[color=#93c47d]Then extract dwmapi.dll and the ue4ss folder to [/color]
[code]Octopath_Traveler0\Octopath_Traveler0\Binaries\Win64[/code]
[/*]
